      "stolen_check": false,
      "study_text": "<p>A majestic drake woven from fog and fading memory,<br data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2206\">It weaves in and out of solidity, rendering <strong>physical attacks</strong> all but useless while shrouded. What’s more, it can <strong>mimic</strong> the skills of others in the mist—each illusion it conjures striking just as true, and often leaving <strong>blindness</strong> in its wake.</p>",
